"}, {"id": 55320, "name": "Creature Collector", "slug": "creature-collector", "language": "eng", "games_count": 1623, "image_background": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/5cc/5cce7cdf7a7436f3baa8c8d01d2bb7b7.jpg"}], "publishers": [{"id": 51684, "name": "Lioncode Games", "slug": "lioncode-games", "games_count": 2, "image_background": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/f17/f177c81ee56e9be3c65904c782969b03.jpg"}], "esrb_rating": null, "clip": null, "description_raw": "Roadmap\nAbout the Game\nWildkeepers Rising is a roguelite RPG bullet heaven where you’ll tame and train a diverse team of Guardian beasts to destroy the invading monster hordes.\nWith some RPG story-elements in between, you’ll face hand-drawn fantasy monsters inspired by the worlds of Akira Toriyama and Jim Henson.FeaturesBullet Heaven  | Shred thousands of monsters in bullet heaven runs\nCreature Collector | Discover, tame, and train magical beasts\nRuns & Builds | Create team synergies with different Guardians\nRoguelike Runs | Take runs with different Wildkeepers wielding different weapons\nProgression | Unlock new Guardians and items and make them stronger between runs\nRPG Elements | Discover a rich world of fantasy heroes and magical monsters.Meet the DevelopersLioncode Games is an indie development duo making Wildkeepers in Early Access to support its expansion with community feedback."}